<MudStack Spacing="3" Style="max-width: 40rem">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
        The reading room opens at nine. Members can reserve a desk from the
        <MudLink Href="components/button">booking buttons</MudLink>, browse the
        <MudLink Href="components/chip">subject tags</MudLink>, or open the
        <MudLink Href="components/menu">catalogue menu</MudLink> to find a title.
    </MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mud-text-secondary">
        Small print also takes the surrounding size:
        <MudLink Href="components/link" Underline="Underline.Always">opening hours and holiday closures</MudLink>.
    </MudText>
</MudStack>
